    "Shares anonymous reliability and performance data from this device. Messages, media, contacts, profile details, and keys are excluded. Turning this off stops sharing analytics." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teilt anonyme Zuverlässigkeits- und Leistungsdaten dieses Geräts. Nachrichten, Medien, Kontakte, Profildetails und Schlüssel sind ausgeschlossen. Das Deaktivieren beendet das Teilen von Analysedaten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shares anonymous reliability and performance data from this device. Messages, media, contacts, profile details, and keys are excluded. Turning this off stops sharing analytics."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparte datos anónimos de fiabilidad y rendimiento de este dispositivo. Se excluyen los mensajes, archivos multimedia, contactos, datos del perfil y claves. Al desactivarlo, se dejan de compartir análisis."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partage des données anonymes de fiabilité et de performance de cet appareil. Les messages, médias, contacts, informations de profil et clés sont exclus. La désactivation arrête le partage des analyses."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Condivide dati anonimi sull’affidabilità e sulle prestazioni di questo dispositivo. Messaggi, contenuti multimediali, contatti, dettagli del profilo e chiavi sono esclusi. Disattivando questa opzione si interrompe la condivisione delle analisi."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compartilha dados anônimos de confiabilidade e desempenho deste dispositivo. Mensagens, mídias, contatos, detalhes do perfil e chaves são excluídos. Desativar interrompe o compartilhamento de análises."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Передаёт анонимные данные о надёжности и производительности этого устройства. Сообщения, медиафайлы, контакты, сведения профиля и ключи исключены. Отключение прекращает передачу аналитики."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu cihazın anonim güvenilirlik ve performans verilerini paylaşır. Mesajlar, medya, kişiler, profil bilgileri ve anahtarlar dahil edilmez. Bu seçeneği kapatmak analiz paylaşımını durdurur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共享此设备的匿名可靠性和性能数据。不包含消息、媒体、联系人、个人资料详情和密钥。关闭此选项会停止共享分析数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分享此裝置的匿名可靠性和效能資料。不包含訊息、媒體、聯絡人、個人檔案詳細資訊和金鑰。關閉此選項會停止分享分析資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
