    "These choices apply to all profiles on this device. Analytics exclude messages, media, contacts, profile details, and keys. Diagnostic logs obscure identifiers and are sent to White Noise for troubleshooting." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Auswahl gilt für alle Profile auf diesem Gerät. Analysedaten schließen Nachrichten, Medien, Kontakte, Profildetails und Schlüssel aus. Diagnoseprotokolle verschleiern Kennungen und werden zur Fehlerbehebung an White Noise gesendet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These choices apply to all profiles on this device. Analytics exclude messages, media, contacts, profile details, and keys. Diagnostic logs obscure identifiers and are sent to White Noise for troubleshooting."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas opciones se aplican a todos los perfiles de este dispositivo. Los análisis excluyen mensajes, archivos multimedia, contactos, datos del perfil y claves. Los registros de diagnóstico ocultan los identificadores y se envían a White Noise para resolver problemas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ces choix s’appliquent à tous les profils de cet appareil. Les analyses excluent les messages, médias, contacts, informations de profil et clés. Les journaux de diagnostic masquent les identifiants et sont envoyés à White Noise pour résoudre les problèmes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Queste scelte si applicano a tutti i profili su questo dispositivo. Le analisi escludono messaggi, contenuti multimediali, contatti, dettagli del profilo e chiavi. I log diagnostici oscurano gli identificatori e vengono inviati a White Noise per risolvere i problemi."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estas opções se aplicam a todos os perfis neste dispositivo. As análises excluem mensagens, mídias, contatos, detalhes do perfil e chaves. Os registros de diagnóstico ocultam os identificadores e são enviados ao White Noise para solucionar problemas."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти настройки действуют для всех профилей на этом устройстве. Аналитика не включает сообщения, медиафайлы, контакты, сведения профиля и ключи. Журналы диагностики скрывают идентификаторы и отправляются в White Noise для устранения неполадок."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu seçimler bu cihazdaki tüm profiller için geçerlidir. Analizlere mesajlar, medya, kişiler, profil bilgileri ve anahtarlar dahil edilmez. Tanılama günlükleri tanımlayıcıları gizler ve sorun gidermek için White Noise’a gönderilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选择适用于此设备上的所有个人资料。分析不包含消息、媒体、联系人、个人资料详情和密钥。诊断日志会隐藏标识符，并发送给 White Noise 用于排查问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些選擇適用於此裝置上的所有個人檔案。分析不包含訊息、媒體、聯絡人、個人檔案詳細資訊和金鑰。診斷記錄會隱藏識別碼，並傳送給 White Noise 以排除問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These packages were found on this profile’s relays and differ from this device’s current package." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
